{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "WRFWeselySurfaceResistance",
    "description": "Surface (canopy) resistance Rc of WRF-Chem's dry-deposition scheme, SUBROUTINE rc of chem/module_dep_simple.F (WRF v4.8.0), for ONE gas at ONE surface state.\n\nThis is a NEW component, not a repair of components/atmospheric_deposition/wesley_dry_gas.esm. That one is a migration of AtmosphericDeposition.jl -- the Wesely (1989) PAPER plus Walmsley & Wesely (1996), over the 11 Wesely land-use categories, with a GEOS-Chem species list -- and WRF's code is a different scheme wearing the same name. Audited against the running model, all 19 overlapping species differ on at least one constant (H2O2's H* by a factor of 671, acetic acid by 235, cresol by 952, and PAN, glyoxal, methylglyoxal and acetic acid have f0 flipped between 0 and 1), it has no dhr temperature correction at all, no Erisman branches, an Rc ceiling of 9999 s/m where WRF has none, and it covers 19 of the 38 gases WRF deposits. Bolting WRF-derived tests onto it would simply have made them red.\n\nFour paths, selected by the gas index. The GENERAL path is Wesely's four parallel resistances with the ground one in series with rac. OZONE differs by using rclo/rgso directly, substituting rluo1/rluo2 outright under dew or rain, and capping rac at 100 s/m. SO2 and NH3 are wholesale ERISMAN ET AL. (1994) replacements: SO2's cuticle resistance is a function of relative humidity, its combination has only three terms and no rac at all, and it collapses to the bare ground resistance over snow, urban/desert soil, water or ice; NH3 bypasses H* and f0 entirely and is read off a table of land class, season, day/night, wetness and temperature. A gas with hstar = 0 never enters the loop and keeps Rc = 1.\n\n`srfres` is what wesely_driver actually passes on, which is Rc except that the last two gas slots -- HO and HO2 for RADM2 -- are zeroed outright so they deposit at the aerodynamic limit.\n\nSCOPE OF THE TESTS, stated plainly. The reference column visits exactly ONE (iland, iseason) pair and never wets the surface: julday 295 puts every call in iseason 2, ivgtyp 2 maps to iland 2, and rhchem never reaches 95 nor is there rain. So the tests below, 7 meteorological states x 43 gases, pin the general path, the O3 path and the dry branches of SO2 and NH3 thoroughly and the wet, rain, snow and other-land-use branches not at all. In particular FORTRAN_BUGS B4 -- the factor-9 disagreement between the two spellings of the cuticle conductance -- lives in the wet branch and is NOT exercised here. A regime sweep that reaches those branches is the next step."
  },
  "models": {
    "WRFWeselySurfaceResistance": {
      "subsystems": {
        "dat": {
          "ref": "./wesely_data.esm"
        },
        "par": {
          "ref": "./wesely_parameters.esm"
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "igas": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 6.0,
          "description": "WRF gas index p_* for chem_opt = 101 (2 = so2, 6 = o3, 16 = nh3, ...). Selects the species constants and which of the four Rc paths applies."
        },
        "iland": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 2.0,
          "description": "USGS land-use category 1..25, WRF's `iland = luse2usgs(ivgtyp)`. NOT a Wesely 11-category index: the tables are pre-expanded over the USGS set."
        },
        "iseason": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 2.0,
          "description": "Seasonal category 1..5. wesely_driver produces only 1 (julday 90..270) or 2 for every non-MOZART mechanism."
        },
        "T": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 288.0,
          "description": "Surface temperature, WRF's tsk(i,j)."
        },
        "rad": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "W/m^2",
          "default": 500.0,
          "description": "Net downward shortwave at the ground, WRF's gsw(i,j). Its being exactly zero is the day/night switch of the NH3 branch."
        },
        "rh": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "%",
          "default": 50.0,
          "description": "Near-surface relative humidity in percent, WRF's rhchem, clamped to [5,100]. Only the SO2 branch reads it."
        },
        "wetflag": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "1 when the surface is dew-wetted (rhchem >= 95), else 0."
        },
        "rainflag": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "1 when it is raining (qr > 1e-18 or raincv > 0), else 0."
        },
        "highnh3": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "1 when chem(nh3) > 2 chem(so2), else 0. Read by the SO2 and NH3 wet branches."
        },
        "r_i": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Minimum stomatal resistance for this land use and season."
        },
        "r_lu": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance."
        },
        "r_ac": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "In-canopy aerodynamic resistance."
        },
        "r_gss": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Ground resistance for SO2."
        },
        "r_gso": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Ground resistance for O3."
        },
        "r_cls": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Lower-canopy resistance for SO2."
        },
        "r_clo": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Lower-canopy resistance for O3."
        },
        "ixxxlu": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Six-class land-use index for this category."
        },
        "hstar": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "M/atm",
          "description": "Effective Henry's law constant at 298 K for this gas."
        },
        "f0": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Normalized reactivity."
        },
        "dhr": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "description": "Temperature coefficient of the Henry's law constant."
        },
        "dratio": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Diffusivity ratio to water vapour."
        },
        "tc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "description": "Surface temperature in Celsius."
        },
        "z_rad": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Stomatal radiation factor 200/(rad+0.1)."
        },
        "rs_open": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Stomatal resistance inside the 0-40 C window."
        },
        "rs": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Bulk stomatal resistance."
        },
        "rdc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "In-canopy buoyant-convection resistance. The Wesely terrain-slope factor is absent because WRF's rdtheta is set to 0 and never assigned (FORTRAN_BUGS B5)."
        },
        "rluo1": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "O3 reference cuticle resistance under dew."
        },
        "rluo2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "O3 reference cuticle resistance under rain."
        },
        "resice": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Ice resistance added to rclx, rgsx and the DRY rlux -- but NOT to the wet or rain rlux, which WRF omits it from."
        },
        "wrk": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "(t0 - T)/(t0 T), the Henry's law exponent argument."
        },
        "hstary": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "M/atm",
          "description": "Temperature-corrected Henry's law constant, hstar exp(dhr wrk)."
        },
        "hstary_d": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "M/atm",
          "description": "hstary floored so a discarded branch stays finite."
        },
        "wet_or_rain": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "1 when either the wet or the rain flag is set."
        },
        "rmx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Mesophyll resistance."
        },
        "rsmx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Stomatal + mesophyll resistance, rs dratio + rmx."
        },
        "rclx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Lower-canopy resistance for this gas."
        },
        "rgsx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Ground resistance for this gas."
        },
        "rlux_dry": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance on a dry surface."
        },
        "rlux_wet": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance under dew."
        },
        "rlux_rain": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance under rain."
        },
        "rlux": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance actually used; rain wins over dew, as in WRF's order of assignment."
        },
        "rc_general": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Surface resistance on the general-gas path: four resistances in parallel, the ground one in series with rac."
        },
        "hstary_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "M/atm",
          "description": "Temperature-corrected Henry's law constant of O3."
        },
        "f0_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "Reactivity of O3 (1.0)."
        },
        "rmx_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Mesophyll resistance of O3."
        },
        "rsmx_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Stomatal + mesophyll resistance of O3."
        },
        "rlux_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Cuticle resistance of O3; under dew or rain it becomes rluo1 or rluo2 OUTRIGHT, not blended."
        },
        "rc_o3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Surface resistance of O3. Differs from the general path in using rclo/rgso directly and in capping rac at 100 s/m."
        },
        "rsmx_so2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Stomatal resistance of SO2 -- with NO mesophyll term, unlike every general gas."
        },
        "rlux_so2_rh": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Humidity-dependent SO2 cuticle resistance."
        },
        "rlux_so2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "SO2 cuticle resistance."
        },
        "rgsx_snow": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Snow/ice ground resistance ramp, shared by SO2 and NH3."
        },
        "rgsx_so2_sfc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "SO2 ground resistance from the wetness and high-NH3 state alone."
        },
        "rgsx_so2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "SO2 ground resistance after the water and snow overrides."
        },
        "rclx_so2_r": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "SO2 lower-canopy resistance; the Erisman branch uses rcls directly."
        },
        "rc_so2_canopy": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "The three-term SO2 combination: stomatal and cuticle in parallel with the SERIES chain rcls + rdc + rgsx. Note there is no rac term at all, unlike every other path."
        },
        "rc_so2": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Surface resistance of SO2, Erisman et al. (1994). Over snow, bare/urban soil, water or ice it collapses to the ground resistance alone."
        },
        "rsmx_nh3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Stomatal resistance of NH3, again with no mesophyll term."
        },
        "is_winter": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "description": "1 for seasonal categories 2, 3 and 5, which the NH3 branch treats together as 'winter, no snow'."
        },
        "nh3_cold": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 resistance below -1 C in the winter branches."
        },
        "nh3_grass": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 over grassland."
        },
        "nh3_agri": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 over agricultural land."
        },
        "nh3_forest": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 over forest and semi-natural ecosystems."
        },
        "nh3_urban": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 over urban and desert soils."
        },
        "nh3_class": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 resistance selected by the six-class land-use index."
        },
        "nh3_snow": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "NH3 snow/ice ramp."
        },
        "rc_nh3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Surface resistance of NH3, Erisman et al. (1994). It bypasses H* and f0 entirely."
        },
        "rc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Surface resistance of this gas, rcx(igas) as rc() returns it."
        },
        "srfres": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "s/m",
          "description": "Rc as wesely_driver passes it on: rcx, except that the last two gas slots (HO and HO2 for RADM2) are set to ZERO, so those two deposit at the aerodynamic limit 1/(Ra+Rb)."
        },
        "n_gas": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 44.0,
          "description": "Number of gas slots, WRF's numgas (44 for chem_opt = 101). wesely_driver zeroes Rc for the LAST TWO slots, so this is what selects HO and HO2."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "r_i",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.ri_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_lu",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rlu_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_ac",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rac_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_gss",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rgss_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_gso",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rgso_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_cls",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rcls_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "r_clo",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.rclo_table",
              "iland",
              "iseason"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ixxxlu",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.ixxxlu_table",
              "iland"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "hstar",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.hstar_table",
              "igas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "f0",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.f0_table",
              "igas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dhr",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.dhr_table",
              "igas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dratio",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "dat.dratio_table",
              "igas"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "tc",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              "T",
              "par.t_celsius"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "z_rad",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              "par.rs_rad_num",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "rad",
                  "par.rs_rad_eps"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rs_open",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "r_i",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  {
                    "op": "^",
                    "args": [
                      "z_rad",
                      2
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  "par.rs_t_num",
                  {
                    "op": "max",
                    "args": [
                      "par.rc_eps",
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          "tc",
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              "par.rs_t_hi",
                              "tc"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rs",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "<=",
                "args": [
                  "tc",
                  0
                ]
              },
              "par.r_big",
              {
                "op": "ifelse",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": ">=",
                    "args": [
                      "tc",
                      "par.rs_t_hi"
                    ]
                  },
                  "par.r_big",
                  "rs_open"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rdc",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "par.rdc_a",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "par.rdc_b",
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          "rad",
                          "par.rdc_c"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rluo1",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      1,
                      "par.rluo1_r"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "par.rluo_mult",
                      "r_lu"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rluo2",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      1,
                      "par.rluo2_r"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "par.rluo_mult",
                      "r_lu"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "resice",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "par.resice_a",
              {
                "op": "exp",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "neg",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          "tc",
                          "par.resice_b"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "wrk",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "par.t_ref",
                  "T"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "par.t_ref",
                  "T"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "hstary",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "hstar",
              {
                "op": "exp",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "dhr",
                      "wrk"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "hstary_d",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              "hstary",
              "par.rc_eps"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "wet_or_rain",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "max",
            "args": [
              "wetflag",
              "rainflag"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rmx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "/",
                    "args": [
                      "hstary_d",
                      "par.rmx_h"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "par.rmx_f",
                      "f0"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rsmx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "rs",
                  "dratio"
                ]
              },
              "rmx"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rclx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              "par.hstar_scale",
                              "hstary_d"
                            ]
                          },
                          "r_cls"
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                          "f0",
                          "r_clo"
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              "resice"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rgsx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                  1,
